## 8. Preview Module [CXC-MOD-PREVIEW]

### Contract

- role: Render live, interactive ComposeIO widgets connected to the design bus. The preview is a running ComposeIO application, not a static mockup.
- class: `PreviewModule`
- position: Bottom panel, separate tab, or detached window.

Detailed specification in [SPEC:CXC-PREVIEW].

### Manifest

```python
MODULE_MANIFEST = {
    "subscribes": [
        "composer/canvas/widget_added", "composer/canvas/widget_removed",
        "composer/canvas/widget_moved", "composer/canvas/widget_resized",
        "composer/canvas/module_added", "composer/canvas/module_removed",
        "composer/canvas/layout_changed",
        "composer/config/widget_changed", "composer/config/module_changed",
        "composer/binding/created", "composer/binding/modified", "composer/binding/removed",
        "composer/connection/status",
    ],
    "publishes": [],
    "design_bus": True,  # Full participant: subscribes AND publishes (widget interactions)
}
```

