## 9. History Module [CXC-MOD-HISTORY]

### Contract

- role: Maintain the undo/redo command stack. Execute undo and redo operations by publishing reverse commands.
- class: `HistoryModule`
- position: Non-visual (no UI frame). Runs as a bus-connected service module.

### Manifest

```python
MODULE_MANIFEST = {
    "subscribes": [
        "composer/command/execute",
        "composer/command/undo", "composer/command/redo",
        "composer/file/loaded", "composer/file/saved",
    ],
    "publishes": [
        "composer/history/stack_changed",
        "composer/file/dirty",
        # Also re-publishes the reverse of undone commands to their original namespaces
    ],
    "design_bus": False,
}
```

### Command Stack

- max-depth: 100 commands (configurable).
- batch-awareness: Commands with the same `batch_id` are grouped as a single entry on the stack. Undoing the batch reverses all commands in reverse order.
- dirty-tracking: Publishes `composer/file/dirty = on` on first command after save. Publishes `off` on save or when undo stack returns to saved state.

### Undo Execution

1. `composer/command/undo` received.
2. Pop last command from undo stack.
3. Read `undo` field from command data.
4. Publish the undo action to the original namespace (e.g., `composer/config/widget_changed` with the old value).
5. Push command to redo stack.
6. Publish `composer/history/stack_changed` with updated can_undo/can_redo flags.

---

## 10. Connection Module [CXC-MOD-CONNECTION]

### Contract

- role: Manage design bus transport connections. Add/remove MQTT, UART, CAN transports. Display connection status.
- class: `ConnectionModule`
- position: Toolbar area or status bar.

### Manifest

```python
MODULE_MANIFEST = {
    "subscribes": [],
    "publishes": [
        "composer/connection/status",
        "composer/connection/transport_added", "composer/connection/transport_removed",
        "composer/connection/discovery",
    ],
    "design_bus": True,  # Manages the design bus's transport layer
}
```

### Connection UI

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Design Bus Connection                           │
│                                                  │
│  Status: ● Connected (MQTT)                      │
│                                                  │
│  Transports:                                     │
│  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │
│  │ ✓ In-process (always on)                   │  │
│  │ ✓ MQTT: broker.local:1883        [Disconnect] │
│  │ ○ UART: /dev/tty.usbserial-*    [Connect]  │ │
│  │ ○ CAN: can0                      [Connect]  │ │
│  └────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │
│                                                  │
│  Discovered Modules: 3                           │
│  ftl-panel (button-matrix) | relay-board-1       │
│  gauge-driver-1                                  │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

- in-process: Always active. Cannot be disconnected.
- mqtt-config: Broker URL, port, optional username/password, QoS level.
- uart-config: Serial port path, baud rate (default: 115200).
- can-config: Interface name, bitrate.
- auto-reconnect: On transport failure, attempt reconnect every 5 seconds. Publish `composer/connection/status = error` immediately, `connecting` on retry, `connected` on success.

---

## 11. Toolbar Module [CXC-MOD-TOOLBAR]

### Contract

- role: File operations (new, open, save, export), mode switching, undo/redo buttons, view toggles.
- class: `ToolbarModule`
- position: Top bar.

### Manifest

```python
MODULE_MANIFEST = {
    "subscribes": [
        "composer/history/stack_changed",
        "composer/file/dirty", "composer/file/path",
        "composer/connection/status",
    ],
    "publishes": [
        "composer/tool/mode", "composer/tool/snap_enabled",
        "composer/tool/grid_size", "composer/tool/show_bindings",
        "composer/command/undo", "composer/command/redo",
        "composer/file/loaded", "composer/file/saved", "composer/file/path",
    ],
    "design_bus": False,
}
```

### Toolbar Layout

```
[New] [Open] [Save] [Export YAML] | [Select] [Place] [Connect] [Pan] | [Undo] [Redo] | [Grid ✓] [Bindings ✓] | ● Connected
```

- file-operations: New clears design state and publishes `composer/file/loaded`. Open reads YAML and publishes `composer/file/loaded`. Save writes YAML and publishes `composer/file/saved`. Export generates deployment-ready ComposeIO YAML.
- mode-buttons: Toggle group — only one active at a time. Publishes `composer/tool/mode`.
- undo-redo: Enabled/disabled based on `composer/history/stack_changed`. Publishes `composer/command/undo` or `composer/command/redo`.
- connection-indicator: Shows design bus status from `composer/connection/status`. Clickable to open Connection module.

### Keyboard Shortcuts

| Shortcut | Action | Bus Message |
|---|---|---|
| Cmd+Z | Undo | `composer/command/undo` |
| Cmd+Shift+Z | Redo | `composer/command/redo` |
| Cmd+S | Save | `composer/file/saved` |
| Cmd+O | Open | File dialog → `composer/file/loaded` |
| V | Select mode | `composer/tool/mode = select` |
| P | Place mode | `composer/tool/mode = place` |
| C | Connect mode | `composer/tool/mode = connect` |
| Space (hold) | Temporary pan | `composer/tool/mode = pan` (revert on release) |
| Delete | Delete selected | `composer/canvas/widget_removed` or `composer/binding/removed` |
| G | Toggle grid | `composer/tool/snap_enabled` toggle |

